4. AI4Bharat IndicCorp corpus
-----------------------------
The Ol Chiki text corpus used to build the training word list and render the
synthetic samples was sourced from the AI4Bharat IndicCorp dataset
(Santali / `sat.txt`). The shipped default lexicon
(`olchiki_ocr/data/lexicon.txt`) is a filtered word list derived from this
corpus. IndicCorpV2 is released under CC0 (public-domain dedication): it may
be used, modified, and redistributed without restriction, and no attribution
is required. AI4Bharat is credited here as a courtesy. (As with any
web-crawled corpus, AI4Bharat's CC0 dedication waives their own rights in the
compiled dataset; it does not purport to grant rights in any underlying
third-party source text.)

